mi","value":"93"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Bishamonten's younger sister and member of the top idol group L☆SEVEN, comprised of the seven lucky goddesses."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Looking up to her older sister, Bishamonten, Shuri performs on the streets while aiming to become an idol."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she is bubbly and seems to have self confidence, there are times when she doesn't give herself enough credit when she compares herself to her successful sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She usually tends to be serious, but can quickly become disinterested and isn't afraid to show it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a normal girl who likes to keep conversations straight to the point."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kisshouten represents prosperity and good luck, along with happiness, beauty, and wealth. Her name is worshiped in hopes of gaining respect, and sometimes even bountiful harvests.From Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54661"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"今、押しも押されぬトップアイドルである七福神たちによる「L☆SEVEN（える・せぶん）」のメンバー毘沙門天の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉である毘沙門天にあこがれアイドルになりたいと思い、今は路上ライブなどで地道に活動しているカミサマ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回、姉をびっくりさせたいと、ナイショで「L☆SEVEN」追加メンバー選抜・次世代福の神オーディションに参加。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"活動的で明るく、己に自信をもっているタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"比較的真面目な性格だが、それゆえやや融通が利かない部分もありツンデレ的な反応をしてしまうこともある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"吉祥天は幸福や美しさ富を象徴する神とされ、美女の代名詞とも言われている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17126","sourceWorkId":"25588","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"今、押しも押されぬトップアイドルである七福神たちによる「L☆SEVEN（える・せぶん）」のメンバー毘沙門天の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉である毘沙門天にあこがれアイドルになりたいと思い、今は路上ライブなどで地道に活動しているカミサマ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回、姉をびっくりさせたいと、ナイショで「L☆SEVEN」追加メンバー選抜・次世代福の神オーディションに参加。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"活動的で明るく、己に自信をもっているタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"比較的真面目な性格だが、それゆえやや融通が利かない部分もありツンデレ的な反応をしてしまうこともある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"吉祥天は幸福や美しさ富を象徴する神とされ、美女の代名詞とも言われている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62267"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2ffb9f65f7fa2e269e5c2e98a8efb02ae14dbc1fc56e9a6fbcbc20bb9b192eea.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/1698ab754c286899c79f4ee443f9eef749923d2d2fc75ab05c69442d013ec86e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北村彩","creatorId":"vndb:s912","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s912","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s912","name":"北村 彩","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:220517:62267:6046:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c54662","characterName":"天鈿 カグラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62268","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"220517"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17127"],"vndbCharacterId":"c54662"},"originalCharacterName":"天鈿 カグラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ame no Uzume is a deity found in Japanese mythology."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With ties to legends such as Iwato Gakure, she's said to be Japan's oldest dancer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She works part-time in a Divine Idol tea shop while building up her idol career from the grassroots level."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"This girl likes to have fun, but that doesn't mean she's a slacker. Her unique rhythm and expressions while dancing are her's alone; no one else can duplicate them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In Ame no Uzume spirit, she usually ends up giving the audience a little more of a risque performance as she easily gets worked up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"There are also times when she relaxes and can stay calm."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a light and playful personality which is reflected in the way she converses with others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Being that she's a natural born seductive goddess, she is not opposed to more raunchy costumes.From Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54662"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"カミサマアイドル喫茶でバイトをしつつ草の根アイドル活動をしているアメノウズメの分霊（わけみたま）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「岩戸隠れ」の伝説で天照大神を呼び戻すために踊ったカミサマであり、日本で最初の踊り子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆるいしゃべり方で、明るく享楽的な性格、楽しいことが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"けれど、踊りに関しては一家言あり努力家な一面もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"独特のリズムや表現で人に真似できないダンスをすることが特技。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アメノウズメの伝承上、人々を楽しませるために興が乗ると脱いでサービスしたくなってしまう性分だが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在の人間社会ではあまり良い事ではないというのは自覚しているため、なるべく人前でそういった事はしないように注意している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17127","sourceWorkId":"25588","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"カミサマアイドル喫茶でバイトをしつつ草の根アイドル活動をしているアメノウズメの分霊（わけみたま）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「岩戸隠れ」の伝説で天照大神を呼び戻すために踊ったカミサマであり、日本で最初の踊り子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆるいしゃべり方で、明るく享楽的な性格、楽しいことが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"けれど、踊りに関しては一家言あり努力家な一面もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"独特のリズムや表現で人に真似できないダンスをすることが特技。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アメノウズメの伝承上、人々を楽しませるために興が乗ると脱いでサービスしたくなってしまう性分だが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在の人間社会ではあまり良い事ではないというのは自覚しているため、なるべく人前でそういった事はしないように注意している。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62268"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e1e30f1530fc76a9c1e2fe8240df2174dfcc0c695f46ee4eb3892a3d5a4eea7c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cfb33acc91e638934f67c150439b96a6ba7af9f71afb71c10af42087e63a5dcc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高橋かな","creatorId":"vndb:s280","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s280","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s280","name":"藤森 ゆき奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:220517:62268:6016:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c54663","characterName":"弁財天 サラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62269","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"220517"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17128"],"vndbCharacterId":"c54663"},"originalCharacterName":"弁財天 サラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"98"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She holds the center position of L☆SEVEN on stage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Benzaiten's blessings are plentiful; she is the goddess of music, good fortune, the arts, victory, and even water."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves singing, but since she hasn't fallen in love yet, and with the abundance of love songs in the idol music genre, she usually becomes doubtful of her ability to sing love songs."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She tends to use an acoustic guitar when casually singing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even though she's always at the center, she's just a regular girl."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She can always be found smiling, which matches her personality. Her tone is calm and collected, and she's sometimes playful during conversations.From Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54663"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「L☆SEVEN（える・せぶん）」のセンターポジションをしているカミサマ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弁財天は、音楽、学芸、戦や財宝についてなど色々なご利益をもち、七福神の一員として信仰されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"水のカミサマでもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カミサマアイドルグループのセンターだが、普段は普通のお姉さんという印象で、いつも微笑みをたたえているおっとりした感じの性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時折茶目っ気のある事も言ったりもする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"歌う事が好きだが、アイドルソングには恋歌が多く、自身がまだ恋をしたことがない事で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"きちんとその歌を歌えているのかという事に悩んでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17128","sourceWorkId":"25588","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「L☆SEVEN（える・せぶん）」のセンターポジションをしているカミサマ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弁財天は、音楽、学芸、戦や財宝についてなど色々なご利益をもち、七福神の一員として信仰されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"水のカミサマでもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カミサマアイドルグループのセンターだが、普段は普通のお姉さんという印象で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも微笑みをたたえているおっとりした感じの性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時折茶目っ気のある事も言ったりもする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"歌う事が好きだが、アイドルソングには恋歌が多く、自身がまだ恋をしたことがない事で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"きちんとその歌を歌えているのかという事に悩んでいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62269"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/934076b07b94ce389154dc0b4020ca286cc9a3242d101aa9ca9c136662729bec.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e993c314adeb2b5d8264fbf46e481a980fb1c29d36e49e6e420d36e0914d901f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actor